    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Regulate fuel to one‑quarter tank</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure the fuel level is no more than 25% of the tank’s capacity to reduce fire risk. Seal the fuel cap securely, and note the fuel gauge reading in the audit. This precaution applies to both “bus bike parcel” scenarios and “bike shifting by train” where fuel handling regulations are strict.</div></div>
